sql.js-httpvfs 0.8.12, vendored from the npm dist. Three files: the UMD entry, the worker, and the wasm the worker loads from beside itself. Pinned because the site has no bundler and no build step, so this is the dependency.

One edit to index.js: createDbWorker also returns the Worker itself as `raw`, so the page can terminate a query that will not finish. The upstream return is {db, worker, configs}; search for "raw:o".
